#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/Q-spine-action.md:1
msgid "Q版人物Spine动作制作需求"
msgstr "Chibi Character Spine Animation Production Requirements"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/Q-spine-action.md:3
msgid "制作要求"
msgstr "Production Requirements"

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/Q-spine-action.md:5
msgid "1.Spine尽可能使用最新版本即可。"
msgstr "1. Use the latest version of Spine whenever possible."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/Q-spine-action.md:6
msgid "2.人物模型的默认姿态需要调整为普通待机动作的第一帧。"
msgstr "2. The character model's default pose should be set to the first frame of the normal idle animation."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/Q-spine-action.md:7
msgid "3."向前移动"和"向后移动"动画在脚步落地时增加事件帧，名为"step"，用于绑定音效。"
msgstr "3. Add an event frame named \"step\" to the \"Forward Move\" and \"Backward Move\" animations when the foot hits the ground, for binding sound effects."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/Q-spine-action.md:8
msgid "4.所有攻击动画需要添加攻击伤害实际发生的事件帧，名为"attack"，用于触发创建弹药或进行攻击命中检测等用途。"
msgstr "4. All attack animations need an event frame named \"attack\" added at the moment attack damage actually occurs, used for triggering projectile creation or attack hit detection."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/Q-spine-action.md:9
msgid "5.攻击动作动画时间最长控制在2s内，特殊待机动画时长不限。"
msgstr "5. Attack animation duration should be kept within 2 seconds maximum. Special idle animation duration is unlimited."

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/Q-spine-action.md:10
msgid "6.人物工程的命名参见"动作表"里人物名称下的英文名称。"
msgstr "6. Character project naming should follow the English names listed under character names in the \"Action Table.\""

#: ../../source/gamedoc/gameplay/game0/requirements/Q-spine-action.md:11
msgid "7.成品仅需提供完整工程文件，不用做导出。"
msgstr "7. Only the complete project file is needed for the final deliverable; no export is required."

